        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-1792, Oblong Beaded Cabinet Pull Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beaded cabinet pull rose has a classic design that will add old world charm to any space. RK International's Beaded Oblong Cabinet Pull Backplate has a 3 inch center to center making it the perfect size for use with almost any cabinet pull. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with matching <a href=\"/products/beaded-edge-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-2617\"><b>Beaded Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-1792, Beaded Cabinet Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BP-1792-finish.jpg?v=1704354673\" width=\"593\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
